{"file":"idmp-plugin-0.1.0-v2.zip","bytes":97555,"status":"已读取","plugins":[{"path":".claude-plugin/plugin.json","name":"idmp-plugin","description":"TDengine IDMP plugin with packaged skills for discovery, schema inspection, and safe operational workflows.","version":"0.1.0","keywords":["TDengine","IDMP","database","monitoring","alert","dashboard","industrial-data","industrial-manufacturing","data-management","iot","time-series","asset-modeling","data-ingestion"]}],"skills":[{"path":"skills/idmp-ai/SKILL.md","name":"idmp-ai","description":"IDMP AI skill. Use it to confirm AI availability and usable data, inspect chat sessions, generate recommended questions or panels, create analyses or panels from prompts, and decide when `record` should persist the session.","headings":["ai","What this skill covers","Recommended reference","Missing context to resolve first","Constrained live behaviors","Execution flow","Evidence of completion","Key commands","Exception paths","Validation scenarios","1. Availability gate","2. Data readiness","3. Session visibility","4. Recommendation path after availability passes","5. Explicit unavailable-backend failure branch"],"name_hint":"idmp · ai","description_zh":"确认 IDMP AI 可用性和可用数据，查看聊天会话、生成推荐问题或面板、依据提示创建分析或面板，并判断何时用 record 持久保存会话。"},{"path":"skills/idmp-analysis/SKILL.md","name":"idmp-analysis","description":"IDMP analysis skill for listing, searching, reading, resuming, and preparing analysis create flows with path, trigger type, sub-template, and output-attribute checks.","headings":["analysis","Recommended shortcuts","Recommended references","Missing context to resolve first","Constrained live behaviors","Evidence of completion","Product behavior to preserve","Key commands","Exception and failure handling","Validation scenarios"],"name_hint":"idmp · 分析","description_zh":"列举、搜索、阅读和恢复 IDMP 分析，并检查路径、触发类型、子模板与输出属性，为创建分析准备条件。"},{"path":"skills/idmp-annotation/SKILL.md","name":"idmp-annotation","description":"IDMP annotation skill. Use it to