"Recommended shortcuts","Recommended reference","Missing context to resolve first","Constrained live behaviors","Operator workflow","Key commands","`data.import-and-export.import` is multipart/form-data in the current schema.","Inspect the schema output first and build the request with the exact transport and fields","(for example `jsonFile` / `taosgenFiles[]`) instead of assuming a plain JSON body.","`data.single-import.create` is also multipart/form-data in the current schema.","Inspect the schema output first and use the exact upload fields instead of guessing a JSON DTO.","Exception paths","Validation scenarios","1. Export root discovery","2. Record baseline","3. Package export"],"name_hint":"idmp · 数据","description_zh":"检查 IDMP 可导出的根元素、查看导入导出记录并下载成果，区分包导出、文件下载和导入流程。"},{"path":"skills/idmp-datasource/SKILL.md","name":"idmp-datasource","description":"IDMP datasource skill. Use it to list and inspect connections, verify connectivity before deeper metadata reads, and diagnose database or table visibility issues instead of stopping at the connection list.","headings":["datasource","What this skill covers","Recommended reference","Missing context to resolve first","Constrained live behaviors","Execution flow","Evidence of completion","Key commands","Exception paths","Validation scenarios","1. Connection discovery","2. Redaction-aware connection read","3. Built-in health check","4. Database and table discovery","5. Metadata closure"],"name_hint":"idmp · datasource","description_zh":"列出检查 IDMP 数据源连接，在深入元数据前验证连通性，诊断数据库或表不可见问题。"},{"path":"skills/idmp-element/SKILL.md","name":"idmp-element","description":"IDMP element skill for locating elementId, resolving business-root paths, browsing children, and preparing downstream analysis or panel work.","headings":["element","Recommended shortcuts","What this skill solves","Element create paths","Evidence of completion","Key commands","Recommended sequence","Exception and failure handling","Validation scenarios"],"name_hint":"idmp · element","description_zh":"定位 IDMP elementId、解析业务根路径、浏览子元素，为后续分析或面板任务准备上下文。"},{"path":"skills/idmp-event/SKILL.md","name":"idmp-event","description":"IDMP event skill for listing, searching, confirming, resending, annotating, and reading event context through the real unacknowledged-event workflow.","headings":["event","Recommended shortcuts","Recommended references","Missing context to resolve first","Constrained live behaviors","Product behavior to preserve","Key commands","Exception and failure handling","Validation scenarios"],"name_hint":"idmp · event","description_zh":"沿实际未确认事件流程列举、搜索、确认、重发和注释 IDMP 事件，并读取事件上下文。"},{"path":"skills/idmp-notification/SKILL.md","name":"idmp-notification","description":"IDMP notification skill. Use it to inspect global notification config, contact points, templates, delivery history, template-level rules, and test-send behavior.","headings":["notification","What this skill covers","Recommended shortcuts","Recommended reference","Missing context to resolve first","Constrained live behaviors","Evidence of completion","Operator workflow","Key commands","Exception and failure handling","Validation scenarios"],"name_hint":"idmp · notification","description_zh":"检查 IDMP 全局通知配置、联系端点、模板、投递历史、模板级规则及测试发送行为。"},{"path":"skills/idmp-openapi-explorer/SKILL.md","name":"idmp-openapi-explorer","description":"IDMP OpenAPI explorer skill. Use it to inspect schema paths, required inputs, and generated commands; fall back to raw API only after schema and generated commands are exhausted.","headings":["OpenAPI Explorer","What this skill covers","Recommended reference","Missing context to resolve first","Constrained live behaviors","Operator workflow","Key commands","Exception paths","Validation scenarios"],"name_hint":"idmp · openapi · explorer","description_zh":"检查 IDMP OpenAPI 的路径、必填输入和生成命令，仅在模式及生成命令无法满足需求后采用原始 API。"},{"path":"skills/idmp-panel/SKILL.md","name":"idmp-panel","description":"IDMP panel skill for listing panels, reading details, creati